abstract: "Reproducible staged wildfire research-portfolio economics with adoption-dependent deployment costs, inverse effectiveness and commissioning-cost targets, technical correlation, and a separate value-of-information example. Includes archived FEMA National Risk Index county building-value expected annual loss data and provenance."
